1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:05,513
Keep the PC powered, connected to the internet, and running Voltura Air.

2
00:00:05,463 --> 00:00:10,824
In its tray menu, open Keep awake and choose an interval or Indefinitely.

3
00:00:10,824 --> 00:00:14,832
Keep screen on and simulated activity are optional.

4
00:00:14,832 --> 00:00:22,461
Keep awake prevents idle sleep while the host runs; it cannot override manual Sleep or closing a laptop lid.

